  "id": "accident-analysis",
  "term": "accident analysis",
  "definition": "Accident analysis is the process of examining past accidents to organize knowledge about how they happened and the factors involved, so that responses to new accidents can be better informed. In this source, it is described as representing accident information and relationships among contributing elements in a structured way to help retrieve and compare similar cases.",
